STRINGTABLE 
BEGIN
    ID_EDIT_CLEAR           "Erase the selection\nErase"
    ID_EDIT_CLEAR_ALL       "Erase everything\nErase All"
    ID_EDIT_COPY            "Copy the selection and put it on the Clipboard\nCopy"
    ID_EDIT_CUT             "Cut the selection and put it on the Clipboard\nCut"
    ID_EDIT_FIND            "Find the specified text\nFind"
    ID_EDIT_PASTE           "Insert Clipboard contents\nPaste"
    ID_EDIT_INSERTRECORDING "Turn a WAV recording (whistle, hum or taps) into notes at the cursor\nInsert recording"
    ID_EDIT_RECORD          "Record from the microphone: whistle, hum or tap, and the notes go in at the cursor\nRecord from microphone"
    ID_EDIT_VOICEEFFECT     "Make a sound effect for a game with your voice: say ""pew"" or ""boing"" into the microphone\nSound effect from your voice"
    ID_INSTRUMENT_LIBRARY   "Ready-made sounds to listen to and add: leads, plucks, pads, basses and drums\nInstrument library"
    ID_EDIT_ADDBACKING      "Fit chords and a bass line to the melody in a channel\nAdd chords and bass line"
    ID_EDIT_DRUMGRID        "Put drums on the noise channel a bar at a time, on a grid of steps, or pick a ready-made beat\nDrum grid"
    ID_VIEW_PROFILE         "Choose how much of FamiTracker shows: a simpler profile for game music, or everything\nProfile"
    ID_VIEW_SHOWEVERYTHING  "All of FamiTracker, or only what the game music profile keeps (View > Profile)\nShow everything"
    ID_HELP_TUTORIALS       "Short tours of FamiTracker that point at each part and go on when you've done what they say\nTutorials"
    ID_VIEW_CELLHINTS       "Say in the status bar what the note, instrument, volume or effect under the cursor does, and in an empty song how to begin\nExplain what's under the cursor"
    ID_VIEW_KEYBOARD        "A piano keyboard along the bottom with the computer keys that play each note on it\nKeyboard"
    ID_EDIT_SAVECLIP        "Keep the selected rows as a clip, to place again later as a copy or linked\nSave selection as clip"
